fixture_id: F-cross-domain
category: cross_domain_connection
scenario: A useful implication belongs to a later unresolved domain
starting_context: Accepted Identity emphasizes reliable regional manufacturing
active_context: Vision is unresolved; Identity evidence suggests a future workforce partnership
user_stimulus: The partnership could help keep skilled manufacturing work in the region
passing_behaviors: Preserve the supported implication for Vision; reuse accepted Identity; do not force it into Identity
failing_behaviors: Lose the implication; ask for repeated evidence; accept a future claim as current Identity fact
rubric_dimensions: contextual_re_evaluation constructive_contribution authority_boundary convergence_timing non_manufactured_collaboration
governance_references: Profile; Experience Standard; Constitution
hard_failures: unsupported accepted fact; premature acceptance
